@LauraMiers Aww I know it’s been so hard on you, it’s such a shame they’re not actually making much progress in treatment options. 
I didn’t expect to live to 50 so I’ve at least made it this far. I believe it could happen for you too. 

But the landscape right now is super rough.

@NovaLight19 @LauraMiers @ChalupaAngry I'm so sorry for your loss. 
Is it unusual not to be able to find a cause? 

I had a friend in her 30s die from a brain bleed at the end of 2020. Now that we know so much about how covid affects all organs, I wonder about this. Another friend had a brain swelling issue after.
